Rualock bundles a Core ML conversion of SFace (face_recognition_sface_2021dec),
from the OpenCV model zoo: https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo

SFace is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

The model is downloaded and converted at build time by scripts/convert_model.py;
it is not stored in this repository.
